maxivmac Tools
==============

Version: %%VERSION%%

Compatibility
-------------
- System 6.0.8: works properly (minor issues)
- System 7.0.1: some stability issues
- System 7.5.3: some stability issues

maxivmac INIT
-------------
Drag "maxivmac INIT" into your System Folder and restart.

Clipboard Sync:
- Automatic copy/paste between Mac and host
- Text and images (PICT) supported
- MacOS Roman to UTF-8 conversion
- Caveat: apps with private scraps need you to switch
  to another app and back to discover clipboard changes

Shared Drive:
- Host folder appears as a Mac volume on the desktop
- Drag and drop a folder from the host to automatically
  mount it as a new shared drive
- File name mapping (long names, illegal characters)
- MacOS Roman conversion including line endings
- Automatic Type/Creator assignment
  (see maxivmac documentation for details)

Host Commands:
- Launch: start a Mac application from the host
- ExitToShell: quit the current app to Finder
- ShutDown: clean power-off from the host

ImportFl / ExportFl
-------------------
- ImportFl: import a file from the host into the Mac
- ExportFl: export a file from the Mac to the host

These are the minivmac versions of these utilities.

For more information: github.com/fstark/maxivmac
